Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.08,0:00:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How long are you gonna stay here, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.08,0:00:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I dunno. You'd be sad if I left, right, Sota?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.83,0:00:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta pee!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmkay, don't fall in!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.37,0:00:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering the same thing, sweetheart.\NHow long are you staying?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.66,0:00:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Why're you asking?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.87,0:00:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuriko... do I not have a home here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.58,0:00:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just wondering if your {\i1}job {\i0}is\Nokay with you being here so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.33,0:00:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back. Kyosuke, Miyamura's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.50,0:00:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.20,0:00:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for having me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.66,0:00:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your best buddy, Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.29,0:00:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.75,0:01:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you for having me...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.16,0:01:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot damn, it {\i1}is {\i0}you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.37,0:01:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.04,0:01:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, it's hot enough without\Nyou smothering him. Get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.87,0:01:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, you sure are sweating hard.\NMakes sense with the summer heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.25,0:01:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, right...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.12,0:01:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's actually a cold sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.33,0:01:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I got an idea, Miyamura-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.00,0:01:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.16,0:01:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You should take a bath with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.41,0:01:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.87,0:01:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already filled the bath.\NFeel free to jump in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.75,0:01:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be a while before dinner is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.83,0:01:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.41,0:01:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't wanna bathe with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.79,0:01:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.08,0:01:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Sweet, let's hop in!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.95,0:01:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,--Aww, don't be shy, it'll be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.87,0:01:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,--Aww, c'mon. Don't be shy.\N--Aww, don't be shy, it'll be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.62,0:01:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,--U-Umm, sir, could I...?\N--Aww, don't be shy, it'll be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.45,0:01:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,--U-Umm, sir, could I...?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.79,0:01:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,K-Kyosuke-san! Please don't freak out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.41,0:01:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,These aren't yakuza tattoos, I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.00,0:01:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.79,0:01:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this is gonna be a dumb question,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.79,0:01:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but these are disposable chopsticks, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.83,0:01:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You ate dinner with them and you just noticed?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.79,0:02:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But Miyamura-kun's got part of a matching set.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.66,0:02:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.16,0:02:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's getting late! I'm sorry\Nfor overstaying my welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.91,0:02:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Might as well just stay the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?! Thanks for the offer, but I shouldn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.45,0:02:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If Izumi-kun sleeps over, we won't\Nhave a futon for you, sweetheart!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.00,0:02:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why's it his?! And why\Ndoes {\i1}he {\i0}get priority over {\i1}me{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.54,0:02:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna sleep over?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.41,0:02:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't want to impose...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.04,0:02:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, ooh! You can sleep in my room!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.25,0:02:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Miyamura-kun's gonna sleep with Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.16,0:02:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Awww!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.95,0:02:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmkay, goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.45,0:02:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry you've gotta share\Na room with this old fart.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.83,0:02:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.87,0:02:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet you wish you were in Kyoko's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.87,0:02:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.12,0:02:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Miyamura-kun.\NWhat do you like about my daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.91,0:02:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I like...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.70,0:02:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,...how she doesn't judge people by appearances.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.04,0:03:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,K-Kyosuke-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.50,0:03:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He passed out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.58,0:03:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Horimiya"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.91,0:04:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"This Summer's Going to Be a Hot One"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.45,0:04:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"This Summer's Going to Be a Hot One"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.45,0:04:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Feels like I barely got any sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.04,0:04:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Feels like I barely got any sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.04,0:04:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.66,0:04:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, g'morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.75,0:05:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She's wearing her middle-school gym clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.04,0:05:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.79,0:05:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a good day at school!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.95,0:05:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Want me to walk you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.16,0:05:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me and you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.08,0:05:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.16,0:05:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.00,0:05:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Izumi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.62,0:05:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,When you leave home in the morning,\Nyou should say "see you later."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.37,0:05:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,S-See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.70,0:05:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.33,0:05:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up... Did they just\Ncome out of the same house?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.37,0:05:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy shit, Hori from Class 1?!\NI thought she was single!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.70,0:05:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori? You have elective with her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.29,0:05:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She's super smart, and pretty cute, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.04,0:05:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.12,0:05:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell is she dating Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.20,0:05:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's crazy! Hell, I'd be\Na way better match for her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.04,0:05:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear Hori-san's dating Miyamura-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.04,0:06:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,For real?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.37,0:06:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That emo-looking guy?! Oh my God,\Nwhat's {\i1}wrong {\i0}with her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.29,0:06:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about terrible taste!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.75,0:06:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all talking shit about\Nthem behind their backs!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.08,0:06:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And they're probably hearing it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.29,0:06:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah! They were yapping\Nabout it in the same damn room!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.83,0:06:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Even people from other classes\Nare joining in on it, too. Assholes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.58,0:06:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. Just when Miyamura\Nhad finally gotten there...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.08,0:06:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Why are {\i1}you {\i0}crying, Yoshikawa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.37,0:06:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There, there, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.54,0:06:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hori. Are you really dating Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.66,0:06:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.04,0:06:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! Bet all the guys you rejected\Nare crying about that right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.54,0:06:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't turn down that many, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.37,0:06:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, don't get all humble on us, Hori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.37,0:06:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't pay attention to them,\NMiyamura. They're all idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.50,0:06:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I told Hori this, too, but keep your chin up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.33,0:07:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine, Miyamura. I don't really care.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.83,0:07:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Aww, where's your hubby?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.87,0:07:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.66,0:07:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit, is he skipping school?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.08,0:07:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.25,0:07:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be here after lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.25,0:07:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell, Ishikawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.45,0:07:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.50,0:07:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.04,0:07:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura-kun! Why'd you cut your hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.20,0:07:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I mean, it's summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.70,0:07:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He cut it 'cause it's summer!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.50,0:07:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.87,0:07:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why are you still\Nwearing your winter uniform?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.37,0:08:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I get cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.29,0:08:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, your piercings are so cool!\NWhen did you get them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.95,0:08:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.08,0:08:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Your family runs a bakery, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.95,0:08:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap... Talk about a cold glare!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.91,0:08:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm kind of cold...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.58,0:08:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, me, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.45,0:08:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This probably won't last long.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.33,0:08:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What won't? What're you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.08,0:08:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it so cold in here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.00,0:08:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,'Sup, Miyamura? How's it hangin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.16,0:08:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Shu, you win the award for Best Reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.50,0:08:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just you, Miyamura! You cut your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.50,0:08:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Changing things up for summer?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.25,0:08:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.54,0:08:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Summer is a good time for that kind of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.45,0:08:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,--Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.08,0:08:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,--That chick just took a picture.\N--Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.00,0:08:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,--That chick just took a picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.12,0:08:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll text it to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.29,0:08:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, that's so gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.04,0:08:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hori--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.87,0:08:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, don't try to outdo them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.66,0:09:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad! Dad, check out his hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.95,0:09:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for havi--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.04,0:09:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.95,0:09:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You're can't recognize your\Nbest buddy after a haircut?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.95,0:09:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Miyamura-kun?! What a transformation!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.70,0:09:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get dumped or something?! Chin up, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.75,0:09:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'd dumped him, I wouldn't bring him over!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.87,0:09:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Shindo"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.87,0:09:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.91,0:09:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Another girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.12,0:09:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No, a friend of mine...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.70,0:09:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What do {\i1}you {\i0}want?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.20,0:09:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.20,0:09:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Citrus"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.20,0:09:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, there...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.95,0:09:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry we're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.20,0:09:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What're you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.70,0:09:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.58,0:09:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura! You've, you've...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.58,0:09:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"My Miyamura"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.58,0:09:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura! You've, you've...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.41,0:09:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"My Miyamura"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.41,0:09:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My sweet, precious Miyamura!\NHe's gone, gone forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.70,0:09:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My sweet, precious Miyamura!\NHe's gone, gone forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.37,0:09:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't belong to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.83,0:10:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Shindo-kun, his hair'll grow back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.45,0:10:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Durian"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.45,0:10:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Shindo-kun, his hair'll grow back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.16,0:10:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Durian"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.16,0:10:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, this is a huge bag. Is it all just candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.95,0:10:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, this is a huge bag. Is it all just candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.58,0:10:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I won an online contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.00,0:10:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave a bunch out to\Npeople in my class already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.12,0:10:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san, what flavor do you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.41,0:10:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.29,0:10:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got pomegranate and fig.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.83,0:10:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any strawberry?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.50,0:10:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Chika took all the normal flavors with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.50,0:10:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So now you've just got the weird ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.66,0:10:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Which flavor is that one, Hori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.37,0:10:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.83,0:10:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheese?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.08,0:10:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheese? You don't like cheese, right, Shindo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.54,0:10:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell no. I'd rather throw my wallet\Nin a ditch than choke down cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.83,0:10:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.83,0:10:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, "ahh."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.37,0:10:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura's feeding me candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.08,0:10:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This may never happen again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.16,0:10:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's cheese flavor... {\i1}Cheese flavor{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.16,0:11:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Are these guys really friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.41,0:11:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it good?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.29,0:11:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it's not, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.95,0:11:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You big meanie!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.33,0:11:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Which flavor's that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.08,0:11:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh, clay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.29,0:11:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Clay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.37,0:11:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really bitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.58,0:11:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.79,0:11:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura, could you get me some water?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.58,0:11:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.16,0:11:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! You're the one who made me eat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.75,0:11:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up, Hori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.50,0:11:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He stole my candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.66,0:11:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Aww, what flavor was it? I have a bunch more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.25,0:11:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm good, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.04,0:11:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, then you should give this flavor a try!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.20,0:12:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right. It tastes like clay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.04,0:12:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The girls've stopped\Ncoming around to bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.12,0:12:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess the novelty wore off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.50,0:12:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, it's a big relief...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.66,0:12:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...? Do you know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.66,0:12:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't think I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.87,0:12:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why was she glaring at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.62,0:12:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Why was she glaring at you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.79,0:12:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.70,0:12:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We were watching TV when it came on\Nout of nowhere! We were so freaked...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.54,0:12:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up, Hori?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.16,0:12:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing, just...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.45,0:12:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.66,0:12:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Who're you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.58,0:12:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you Miyamura-senpai's girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.41,0:12:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.58,0:12:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.04,0:12:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to bother you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.50,0:13:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, she's really freaking me out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.83,0:13:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.00,0:13:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.20,0:13:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,When are you breaking up with her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.20,0:13:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.04,0:13:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,When are you breaking up with Hori-senpai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.12,0:13:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.45,0:13:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he two-timing her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.37,0:13:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.75,0:13:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,When are you breaking up with her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.83,0:13:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.70,0:13:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Honoka Sawada from\NClass 2-5, and I'll be back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.58,0:13:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You really don't have to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.83,0:13:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.91,0:13:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.62,0:13:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So she's a second-year, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.70,0:13:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,She comes to stalk me on every break.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.95,0:13:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What's her name again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.95,0:13:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Honoka Sawada!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.75,0:13:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,See?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.58,0:14:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, what do you want?\NWhy do you keep following him around?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.08,0:14:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.29,0:14:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You just {\i1}what{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.41,0:14:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.20,0:14:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help it! I like you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.08,0:14:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea you were taken!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.16,0:14:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so lanky and has so many\Npiercings! Why do you like him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.00,0:14:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a crush on you {\i1}first{\i0}, Hori-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.87,0:14:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What a twist!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.08,0:14:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishikawa-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.20,0:14:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I was listening in\N'cause it looked hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.37,0:14:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, quit it! Can you do something about her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.00,0:14:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh, Sawada-san? Could you let go of--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.12,0:14:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut it, you no-good punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.62,0:14:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What'd you say I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.87,0:14:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.04,0:14:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Yoshikawa, come to the entrance.\NYou gotta see this."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.25,0:14:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Yoshikawa, come to the entrance.\NYou gotta see this."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.25,0:14:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.50,0:14:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Yoshikawa, come to the entrance.\NYou gotta see this."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.50,0:14:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.58,0:14:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"SENT"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.58,0:14:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.79,0:14:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.00,0:14:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sawada-san, if you were a guy,\NI would've headbutted you by now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.87,0:14:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I like her more than you! I {\i1}love {\i0}her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.29,0:14:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you even like this guy, Hori-senpai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.91,0:15:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... Let me think for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.75,0:15:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to think about it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.12,0:15:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,She's {\i1}mine{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.41,0:15:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Took you long enough, Yoshikawa.\NThe show's practically over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.37,0:15:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I dunno, this is still pretty damn funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.50,0:15:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-senpai! I made these in home ec!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.20,0:15:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your paws off her, Sawada.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.16,0:15:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There they go again...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.20,0:15:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, Miyamura! Shut your piehole!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.25,0:15:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not shutting {\i1}anything{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.75,0:15:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-senpai told me I could still talk to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.66,0:15:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Hori-senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.54,0:15:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, I said that...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.41,0:15:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the bell! Let's get back to class!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.04,0:15:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.70,0:15:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.00,0:15:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Please listen to your {\i1}boyfriend{\i0}.\NLet's go back to class.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.91,0:15:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.79,0:15:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.37,0:16:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.50,0:16:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sawada, you freaking--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.33,0:16:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to stop popping in out of nowhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.91,0:16:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Hori-senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.83,0:16:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,She went home early to get some stuff done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.37,0:16:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll go home, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.37,0:16:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why're you going this way?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.58,0:16:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Why're {\i1}you {\i0}going this way?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.79,0:16:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.25,0:16:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.04,0:16:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of whacky coincidence {\i1}is {\i0}this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.50,0:16:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, jeez, I left the key inside...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.29,0:17:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.16,0:17:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.00,0:17:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you just let anyone and everyone\Ninto your place, Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.37,0:17:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not just anyone. Hori-san\Ndoesn't even come over that often.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.08,0:17:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.66,0:17:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe things aren't going as well as I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.91,0:17:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I just always go over to her place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.50,0:17:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.20,0:17:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Miyamura, do you have any siblings?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.20,0:17:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope, it's just me, my mom, and my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.29,0:17:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I totally assumed you had\Na little brother or sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.62,0:17:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.87,0:17:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cause you're good at taking care of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.33,0:17:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.04,0:17:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Why're you laughing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.29,0:17:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.04,0:17:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Honoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.95,0:18:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.37,0:18:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I had an older brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.62,0:18:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.75,0:18:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a year older than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.04,0:18:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kidding! I made it all up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.33,0:18:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.62,0:18:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, I'm just joking around!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.58,0:18:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, they're home!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.04,0:18:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks again for the cake. See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.58,0:18:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sawada?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.08,0:18:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You can come over for cake whenever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.33,0:18:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.75,0:18:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that did happen to the Sawadas next door.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.58,0:18:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so sad that they had\Nto lose their eldest like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.79,0:18:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You probably didn't see him much,\Nsince he went to a different school.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.58,0:18:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When'd he die?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.04,0:18:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Last year in... I don't remember when.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.70,0:18:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a nice boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.08,0:18:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.70,0:18:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Her older brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.12,0:19:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Who're you waiting for, Sawada-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.66,0:19:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.20,0:19:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right! You're trying to\Nambush Hori-san! Go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.33,0:19:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are?!\NYou're not the boss of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.45,0:19:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.29,0:19:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You free right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.58,0:19:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so short. First-year?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.58,0:19:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, she got quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.91,0:19:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You scared of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.75,0:19:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.20,0:19:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.62,0:19:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,At least tell us what your first name is!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.37,0:19:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.87,0:19:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh... wanna head home?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.50,0:19:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.29,0:19:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.50,0:19:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just trying to think of what to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.66,0:19:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Do guys make you uncomfortable, Sawada?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.16,0:19:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Kinda.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.41,0:19:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I'm {\i1}also {\i0}a guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.58,0:20:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, Hori-senpai sure is late!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.91,0:20:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.58,0:20:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry that took so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.20,0:20:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I've taken a bath at Hori-san's house!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.95,0:20:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Then I'm gonna do that, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.58,0:20:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not allowed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.41,0:20:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Says you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.12,0:20:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,--S-Someone, help...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.00,0:20:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,--Can we finish watching this later?\N--S-Someone, help...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.66,0:20:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,--Can we finish watching this later?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.12,0:20:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I gotta return it tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.50,0:20:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Horror movies {\i1}really {\i0}freak me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.00,0:20:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe my own daughter\Nwould bully me like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.87,0:20:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, they scare me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.50,0:20:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This whole series is about a girl\Nplanning to murder her father!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.04,0:20:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're reading too much into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.75,0:20:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really like this movie that much, Hori?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.54,0:20:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I {\i1}so {\i0}relate to this main character.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.54,0:20:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Their relationship's a lost cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.50,0:20:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,All this time, I sucked it up and took it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.87,0:20:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But not anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.37,0:20:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go buy smokes!\NDon't come looking for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.95,0:21:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.45,0:21:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You never make any moves on me, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.54,0:21:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.75,0:21:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.08,0:21:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the one who said it,\Nbut now she's all embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.91,0:21:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.29,0:21:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing, just thought\Nyou were being really cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.75,0:21:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.50,0:21:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san, what kind of moves\Ndo you want me to make?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.91,0:21:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.16,0:21:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Miya--
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.00,0:21:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyoko-chan! You got any change?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.62,0:21:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, how embarrassing!\NI totally forgot my wallet!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.00,0:22:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up, Kyoko?
